# `describe` after `render` is DS0120, and the fix moves `render` to the end.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | render table | describe
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..44
  PIPELINE@0..43
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    RENDER_OP@20..32
      IDENT@20..26 "render"
      WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
      IDENT@27..32 "table"
    WHITESPACE@32..33 " "
    PIPE@33..34 "|"
    WHITESPACE@34..35 " "
    DESCRIBE_OP@35..43
      IDENT@35..43 "describe"
  WHITESPACE@43..44 "\n"

error[DS0120]: `render` must be the last operator
  --> query:1:21
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | render table | describe
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^   -------- this operator comes after `render`
  |                     |
  |                     the chart is drawn at this point
  |
  = help: move `render table` to the end of the query

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | describe | render table
which parses without errors
